# Docs MDX — prettier's plugin chain rewrites the embedded tsx-live code
# fences: it turns {/* comments */} into block statements, prepends ASI
# semicolons, reorders Tailwind classes on the pages that teach class order,
# and on the widget pages emits an empty file. The examples are the content
# here, so none of these files go through the formatter.
docs/**/*.mdx

# Plans and brainstorms quote MDX inside fenced blocks; the formatter
# collapses the nested fences and silently drops their contents.
docs/plans/**/*.md
docs/brainstorms/**/*.md

